WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.720
Meet Nova. A browser designed around focus, speed, and your own space.

00:05.850 --> 00:11.609
Organize your day with vertical tabs, isolated workspaces, and an instant command bar.

00:12.050 --> 00:18.106
Work side by side in Split View, while inactive tabs quietly hibernate to save memory.

00:18.450 --> 00:24.914
Ask Nova Assistant anything. Powered by WebGPU, local models run right on your device.

00:25.250 --> 00:31.085
Built-in protection blocks trackers automatically, and end-to-end encryption keeps your sync private.

00:31.000 --> 00:36.000
Free and open source for Mac, Windows, and Linux. Make room for Nova.
